{:name "tenancy-admin"
 :version "1.0.0"
 :description "Tenancy addon control-plane UI — org-admin panels served via the route-collection seam. Loaded ONLY when the addon is active (`:extra-package-names`); references the addon's `:grant`/`:org`/… entities, so its base-fns throw without the addon schema."
 ;; Depends on `app-base` for the auth route templates
 ;; (`:get-auth-required`, `:post`, `:post-route`, `:delete`) — its ONLY
 ;; former reason to depend on `app`; on `web` for `:router-or-nil` +
 ;; HTML/response primitives, on `core` for the hiccup/collection
 ;; primitives. No dependency on the editor package `app` anymore, so the
 ;; addon control-plane loads without pulling the editor UI. `app-base`
 ;; does NOT depend on this package — the dependency stays one-way.
 :dependencies ["core" "web" "app-base"]
 :modules ["grants" "users" "registration" "my-app" "apps" "auth" "router"]}
